{"id":"medlenno","lemma":"медленно","pos":"adv","rank":915,"glosses":["slowly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/17/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Мой дедушка говорит очень медленно.","en":"My grandfather speaks very slowly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/655934","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"grandfather"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Говорите, пожалуйста, медленно.","en":"Please speak slowly.","words":[{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},{"g":"please"},null]},{"text":"Моя мать говорит медленно.","en":"My mother speaks slowly.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"мой"},{"g":"mother"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"},null]},{"text":"Он медленно ходит.","en":"He walks slowly.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"ходить"}]},{"text":"Мне надо есть медленно.","en":"I must eat slowly.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"must, necessary"},{"g":"there is / to eat"},null]}]}